  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">support for 2,600 people  victims of malnutrition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Madagascar faces the phenomenon of undernutrition known locally as &quot;Kere&quot;. According to media and United Nations sources, for the month of November 2022 to March 2023, 2,023,000 people are in the grip of famine, of which 1.97 million in crisis phase, 250,000 people are classified in a situation of alert and 72% of Madagascar South people on advanced famine.  The project contribute to strengthening the resilience of vulnerable 2.600 persons hit by famine in the regions of the South and South Est</narrative>
  </description>
